  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Map Data to a Profile\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Decide what one profile represents.\r\n   *Example: a person, a creator, or a character*\r\n\r\n2. Label each part of the profile with the kind of information it should show.\r\n\r\n3. Make sure your labels match your topic.\r\n\r\n4. Save your work to your **Backpack** so you can use it in the next level.",
    "display_name": "Map Data to Profiles",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Plan the data used in each profile by labeling what information appears in every item. This helps you prepare for generating and displaying multiple profiles.",
